# Project Title: Black Jack

## Description

This code is used to help the user play a game of black jack against the user. A few assumptions being made in this game are:

1. Each card has a equal probability of being pulled
2. We are pulling from an infinite deck of cards - Can't run out of any card

### Dependencies

Optional: ASCII_Art.py - this script has the logo for the Calculator. Not mandatory, but adds a little bit of flavour to the mix.

### Installations Needed

NA

